        "notes": "Wrongly Accused is about solving crime. Some of the crimes are minor in nature such as theft, however, others involve murder.\r\n\r\nNo acts of violence are seen or portrayed visually in the game, however, descriptions of how crimes were carried out are present. This is in the manner of any other murder mystery where the focus is on means and motive more than the act itself.\r\n\r\n"
